// CALENDAR_SYNC -- seed local marks from the server's per-resource self-done
// flag (data.lessons[].selfDone from /donow). Makes the calendar grey-out follow
// the student's LOGIN, not the browser: a lesson marked Done on ANY device greys
// on every device. Additive + idempotent -- only SEEDS a synthetic
// '<topic>|server' mark (never removes one), so it never clobbers a real local
// mark and a 2nd pass is a no-op. localLessonState matches any '<topic>|*' with a
// ts, so the synthetic mark greys the lesson exactly like a local Done. Returns
// true if it added anything (the caller then re-renders the calendar). Never throws.
